        "quote": "(d) All commercial, residential, trade, excavation, elevator, framing, concrete, demolition, swimming pool, roofing, fire alarm, and fire sprinkler contractors shall carry workers compensation insurance as required by State law.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.63.020:block:3#text",
